  "prefLabel": "Plc 1804.03 Notification Required Prior to Training",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1804.03 Notification Required Prior to Training. Unless statutorily authorized to assess property pursuant to RSA 75:1, RSA 81:1, RSA 41:2-g, or RSA 48:13, no individual shall be trained to perform measuring and listing of property or the making of appraisals for tax assessment purposes unless the certified professional supervising the training has:\n\n(a) Provided a written notification to the OPLC at the address in Plc 103.03 that includes the following information:\n\n(1) The name and the residential address of the individual being trained;\n\n(2) The name of each municipality in which the individual will be trained;\n\n(3) Results of the criminal background check or a statement that the request has been submitted and the results will be sent to the OPLC as soon as they are received; and\n\n(4) The name of each certified property assessor supervisor, certified property assessor, and certified property assessor assistant who will supervise the training; and\n\n(b) Providing a copy of the notification required by (a), above, to the DRA, to the attention of the director of the municipal and property division.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
}
